# 统一 LF：shell / SQL / compose / nginx 等将在 Ubuntu 云服务器执行的文件，
# CRLF 会导致 bash 报错与 compose 解析异常（见 ADR-007 配套约定）
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
*.properties text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.java text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf

# 二进制
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
